[engl]
{100}{}{Morbid}
{200}{}{You see Doc Morbid.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{First time}
{1020}{}{Back}
{1030}{}{Night}
{2000}{}{Oh, It's a customer! What can I help you with?}
{2010}{}{I need healing.}
{2020}{}{I need healing.}
{2030}{}{Wock!}
{2040}{}{I know about you and Iguana Bob, you filthy butcher.}
{2050}{}{Nothing, just making small talk.}
{2060}{}{You seem excited to see me. Why?}
{3000}{}{I'm sorry, I don't treat idiots at night. Something about full moons and lunacy, I
suppose. Have a good night.}
{3010}{}{[Done.]}
{4000}{}{Ahh, a repeat customer. Excellent these days! How can I help you?}
{4010}{}{I need healing.}
{4020}{}{I need healing.}
{4030}{}{Nothing, just making small talk.}
{4040}{}{Wock!}
{4050}{}{I know about you and Iguana Bob, you filthy butcher.}
{5000}{}{Now, half of what you have just seen is mine again.}
{5010}{}{YOU RIPPED OUT MY EYE! YOU MOTHER . . .}
{6000}{}{Now, now. Watch your language.}
{6010}{}{[Done.]}
{7000}{}{Trespasser! This is a private room!}
{7010}{}{[Done.]}
{8000}{}{Don't try to talk your way out of this one!}
{8010}{}{[Done.]}
{9000}{}{Hmm, lets have a look.}
{9010}{}{[Proceed examination...]}
{10000}{}{You seem to be in nearly perfect health. That will be $10 for the examination.}
{10010}{}{Here you go. Take your money.}
{10020}{}{Ten caps for you to tell me that? You gotta be kidding.}
{11000}{}{I never joke. Especially when it comes to physical trauma. You will pay or I'll have to
resort to other forms of compensation, many of which are much more painful then just
paying my fee.}
{11010}{}{Ok, here's your money.}
{11020}{}{Bite me. I'm leaving.}
{12000}{}{Ok, I have your test results:}
{12010}{}{[Show results...]}
{13000}{}{You are moderately wounded.}
{13010}{}{[Proceed...]}
{14000}{}{You are near death.}
{14010}{}{[Proceed...]}
{15000}{}{There you go. Come back again!}
{16000}{}{The total cost will be $@lex price@. Payment is due before treatment. No exceptions. Will you pay?}
{16010}{}{Yes, I will pay.}
{16020}{}{Ya.}
{16030}{}{No, I don't have the money. Will you float me?}
{16040}{}{No.}
{16050}{}{Nuh.}
{17000}{}{Thank you for your business. Come again.}
{17010}{}{[Done.]}
{18000}{}{You do not have enough money. I have a very special way of dealing with debtors - I
don't. Flash and Cougar, take our new found source of income to the lab for processing.}
{18010}{}{[Done.]}
{19000}{}{Have it your way. Cougar, Flash. Show our 'patient' to the lab.}
{19010}{}{[Done.]}
{20000}{}{Excellent. Let's begin. This might hurt a little . . .}
{20010}{}{[Done.]}
{21000}{}{No. I don't loan anyone, and I mean anyone, any amount of money. Go away, you pauper.}
{21010}{}{[Done.]}
{22000}{}{It's your life. Good-Bye.}
{22010}{}{[Done.]}
{23000}{}{Wh . . . what could you possibly mean?}
{23010}{}{I had a little conversation with your troll . . .}
{24000}{}{[He looks shiftily from side to side] That proves nothing. Gretch is a little . . . slow
in the head. No one listens to him around here. You had best leave.}
{24010}{}{[Done.]}
{25000}{}{Well, if you do need anything, please stop by. No one can beat my service!}
{25010}{}{[Done.]}
{26000}{}{My business has dropped off recently. I'm happy to see any customers, these days. Not
that I mind your company, of course.}
{26010}{}{Excellent, I need some healing.}
{26020}{}{Of course, I understand. Have a good day.}
{26030}{}{Why has your business dropped off?}
{27000}{}{In case you haven't noticed, I got some competition.@@
Complaining to Killian won't do anything. He doesn't see anything wrong with the newcomers.@@Those damn Children have moved in next door, and all, um, much of my business has gone to them. I don't like it, but I can't lower my prices to match theirs. I can only provide better service.}
{27010}{}{Ahh, I do need some healing.}
{27020}{}{Hmm, better prices, interesting. Thank you.}
{28000}{}{You again. I hope you have another good reason for disturbing me . . .}
{28010}{}{Aggh!}
{29000}{}{I hope you have a good reason for disturbing me. My time is extremely valuable.}
{29010}{}{Aggh!}
{30000}{}{Oh, back so soon. What can I help you with?}
{30010}{}{I need healing.}
{30020}{}{Wock!}
{30030}{}{I know about you and Iguana Bob, you filthy butcher.}
{30040}{}{Nothing, just making small talk.}
{31000}{}{Please make it somewhere else, I'm busy.}
{31010}{}{[Done.]}
{32000}{}{Oh, It's you again. I like your style, even if I don't like you. What can I help you
with, now?}
{32010}{}{I need healing.}
{32020}{}{Wock!}
{32030}{}{Nothing, just making small talk.}
{33000}{}{I'm Doc Morbid, can I help you?}
{33010}{}{Yeah, I need some help.}
{33020}{}{I need some medical assistance.}
{33030}{}{Ya.}
{33040}{}{No, not today.}
{33050}{}{I know about you and Iguana Bob, you filthy butcher.}
{34000}{}{Well, if not today, then perhaps sometime in the near future.}
{34010}{}{Hopefully not. Bye.}
{35000}{}{Hmmm. I don't like your looks, stranger. But what can I do for you? I never, ever turn
away a paying customer.}
{35010}{}{I need some help.}
{35020}{}{I need some medical assistance.}
{35030}{}{Hep.}
{35040}{}{Nothing today, thanks.}

